2026-10-24T02:22:58.2632028Z Linux USB/IP device management (experimental preview)
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2632255Z 
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2632354Z Usage: rustusb [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2632492Z 
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2632542Z Commands:
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2632747Z   logs                Read sanitized stored logs or authorized agent audit projections
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2633174Z   agent               Run or query the nonroot shared application service using fixed profiles
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2633692Z   secure-server       Serve configured devices with mandatory mutual TLS and per-device authorization
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2634372Z   secure-discover     Read the stable-key device catalog over the configured mutually authenticated TLS endpoint
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2634961Z   secure-attach       Import the configured stable device key and own its encrypted VHCI relay until stopped
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2635637Z   native-pending      Inspect unresolved secure Native channels through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2636343Z   native-reconcile    Verify a stopped Native channel and retire its record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2636892Z   physical-pending    Inspect unresolved physical grants through the root helper (root only)
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2637453Z   physical-reconcile  Verify restored physical state and retire its grant record (root only; no USB writes)
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2638062Z   physical-server     Serve explicitly authorized whole USB devices through Linux USBFS (experimental, no TLS)
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2638674Z   virtual-server      Serve two virtual test devices; this experimental mode provides no authentication or TLS
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2639280Z   devices             Scan local devices without changing drivers. Discovery is not compatibility validation
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2639786Z   doctor              Read installed tool, module and helper capabilities without loading modules
2026-10-24T02:22:58.2640285Z   discover            Query a server's USB/IP device list over an administrator-managed trusted network
